{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓劇《再婚皇后》男星朱智勛與合作16年的Blitzway事務所約滿後，決定離巢自立門戶，準備與一直合作的經紀管理室長一同成立個人公司。身為Blitzway主要股東的他，持股市值在短短8個月內減少約32.33億韓圜（約1,890萬港元）。Blitzway昨日發聲明表示尊重並支持朱智勛正在籌備個人公司的計畫，也衷心祝願他未來一切順利。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:27:21.655096+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T02:58:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T03:40:58.056753+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T03:20:46.042566+00:00","content_hash":"ffcfa8f0578ea43350ca6e17bf74c82896e4c8f7eece8209a1b9c6adb3b6eb76","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:27:21.655096+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}